p Now</a></p></div>","content":"<div style=\"color:#FFFFFF;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-secondary-200 text-light\"><h4 style=\"text-align:center;\">Ring the bell to help fight hunger and homelessness</h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\"><a href=\"https://give.salvationarmygeorgia.org/give/618818/#!/donation/checkout\" class=\"btn btn-light gap-1 mt-2\">Help Now</a></p></div>","description":"Text with HTML references.","draggable":true,"model":"6","position":0,"fullName":"content:wysiwyg_basic:2:74","htmlElement":"html","primarytype":"content","id":"content:wysiwyg_basic:2:74","styles":{},"newLoc":"design:columns:1 column - 1 row my-3:24:40-1:1 column - 1 row:0","oldLoc":"bank","contentOverride":false,"manualContent":"<div style=\"background-color:#2A313F;color:#FFFFFF;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3\"><h4 style=\"text-align:center;\">Ring the bell to help fight hunger and homelessness</h4>\n\n<p style=\"text-align:center;\" class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-center\"><a href=\"https://give.salvationarmygeorgia.org/give/618818/#!/donation/checkout\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Help Now</a></p></div>"},"content:wysiwyg_basic:5:92":{"icon":"outdent","name":"WYSIWYG","type":"wysiwyg_basic","html":"<div style=\"color: #111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark\">\n<div class=\"section-container\">\n<div class=\"section-row\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><a href=\"https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/metro-atlanta/ring-the-bell/?campaign=527168\" target=\"\"> <img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/9017140e-1127-4e52-9a27-8b60df6e8c90_Salvation+Army+Bell+%281080+x1920%29.png\" class=\"d-block mx-auto img-fluid rounded\" width=\"295\" style=\"max-width: 100%; padding-right: 15px; padding-left: 15px; padding-bottom: 20px; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<h4>We Need Your Help</h4>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">Did you know that <span style=\"color: #ed1c2b;\"><strong>1 in 5 kids will go to bed hungry</strong></span> tonight or that <span style=\"color: #ed1c2b;\"><b>1 in 13 seniors have to choose between life-saving medication and food</b></span>?</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">And did you know that <span style=\"color: #ed1c2b;\"><b>2,700 individuals</b></span> in the Atlanta area won’t have a warm, safe place to sleep tonight?</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">These are challenges many of our neighbors face every single day. They are real people with real struggles that threaten their families, threaten their health, threaten their hope that things will ever get better.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #ed1c2b;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">With your support, The Salvation Army of Metro Atlanta will meet these needs throughout metro Atlanta.</span></b></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #ed1c2b;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"></span></b></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">Ring the Bell atl, and join us in our fight to bring aid, comfort and hope to those who need it!</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">One gift can save one person… many can save many.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-start\"><a href=\"https://give.salvationarmygeorgia.org/give/618818/#!/donation/checkout\" class=\"btn btn-primary gap-1 mt-2\">Ring the Bell</a></p>\n<p class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-start\"></p>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Thank You!</span></strong></h4>\n<p></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","content":"<div style=\"color: #111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3 bg-light text-dark\">\n<div class=\"section-container\">\n<div class=\"section-row\" style=\"display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; align-items: center; width: 100%;\">\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\"><a href=\"https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/metro-atlanta/ring-the-bell/?campaign=527168\" target=\"\"> <img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/9017140e-1127-4e52-9a27-8b60df6e8c90_Salvation+Army+Bell+%281080+x1920%29.png\" class=\"d-block mx-auto img-fluid rounded\" width=\"295\" style=\"max-width: 100%; padding-right: 15px; padding-left: 15px; padding-bottom: 20px; display: block; margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto;\"> </a></div>\n<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\" style=\"box-sizing: border-box;\">\n<h4>We Need Your Help</h4>\n<p></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">Did you know that <span style=\"color: #ed1c2b;\"><strong>1 in 5 kids will go to bed hungry</strong></span> tonight or that <span style=\"color: #ed1c2b;\"><b>1 in 13 seniors have to choose between life-saving medication and food</b></span>?</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">And did you know that <span style=\"color: #ed1c2b;\"><b>2,700 individuals</b></span> in the Atlanta area won’t have a warm, safe place to sleep tonight?</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">These are challenges many of our neighbors face every single day. They are real people with real struggles that threaten their families, threaten their health, threaten their hope that things will ever get better.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #ed1c2b;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">With your support, The Salvation Army of Metro Atlanta will meet these needs throughout metro Atlanta.</span></b></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #ed1c2b;\"><b><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"></span></b></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">Ring the Bell atl, and join us in our fight to bring aid, comfort and hope to those who need it!</span><span style=\"font-size: 12.0pt;\"></span></p>\n<p><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\">One gift can save one person… many can save many.</span></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: 'Arial',sans-serif;\"></span></p>\n<p class=\"d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-start\"><a href=\"https://give.salvationarmygeorgia.org/give/618818/#!/donation/checkout\" class=\"btn btn-primary gap-1 mt-2\">Ring the Bell</a></p>\n<p class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-start\"></p>\n<h4><strong><span style=\"font-size: 18px;\">Thank You!</span></strong></h4>\n<p></p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>","description":"Text with HTML references.","draggable":true,"model":"6","position":1,"fullName":"content:wysiwyg_basic:5:92","htmlElement":"html","primarytype":"content","id":"content:wysiwyg_basic:5:92","styles":{},"newLoc":"design:columns:1 column - 1 row my-3:24:40-1:1 column - 1 row:0","oldLoc":"bank","contentOverride":false,"manualContent":"<div style=\"background-color:#FFFFFF;color:#111111;\" class=\"rounded p-6 gap-3\"><div class=\"section-container\">\n\t<div class=\"section-row\">\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<a href=\"https://southernusa.salvationarmy.org/metro-atlanta/ring-the-bell/?campaign=527168\" target=\"\"><img src=\"https://s3.amazonaws.com/uss-cache.salvationarmy.org/9017140e-1127-4e52-9a27-8b60df6e8c90_Salvation+Army+Bell+%281080+x1920%29.png\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;padding-right:15px;padding-left:15px;padding-bottom:20px;display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto;\" class=\"d-block mx-auto img-fluid rounded\"></a>\n\t\t</div>\n\n\t\t<div class=\"col-lg-6 col-md-12 col-sm-12\">\n\t\t\t<h4>We need your help</h4>\n\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\">Did you know that <span style=\"color:#ed1c2b;\"><strong>1 in 5 kids will go to bed hungry</strong></span> tonight or that <span style=\"color:#ed1c2b;\"><b>1 in 13 seniors have to choose between life-saving medication and food</b></span>? </span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"></span><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"></span>\n\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\">And did you know that <span style=\"color:#ed1c2b;\"><b>2,700 individuals</b></span> in the Atlanta area won’t have a warm, safe place to sleep tonight?</span>\n\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"></span>\n\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\">These are challenges many of our neighbors face every single day. They are real people with real struggles that threaten their families, threaten their health, threaten their hope that things will ever get better.</span>\n\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"color:#ed1c2b;\"><b><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\">With your support, The Salvation Army of Metro Atlanta will meet these needs throughout metro Atlanta.</span></b></span>\n\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\">Ring the Bell atl, and join us in our fight to bring aid, comfort and hope to those who need it!</span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\"></span>\n\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p style=\"text-align:justify;\">\n\t\t\t\t<span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\">One gift can save one person… many can save many. </span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\"><span style=\"font-family:&quot;Arial&quot;,sans-serif;\"></span></span><span style=\"font-size:12.0pt;\"></span>\n\t\t\t</p>\n\n\t\t\t<p class=\"cta-button-group d-flex flex-wrap gap-2 my-3 justify-content-start\"><a href=\"https://give.salvationarmygeorgia.org/give/618818/#!/donation/checkout\" class=\"btn btn-light\">Ring the Bell</a></p>\n\n\t\t\t<h4><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Thank You!</span></h4>\n\n\t\t\t<p>\n\t\t\t\tIf you are looking to register to be a bell ringer in person, click <a href=\"https://www.registertoring.com/\" target=\"\">here</a>.\n\t\t\t</p>\n\t\t</div>\n\t</div>\n</div>\n</div>"},"design:design:whitespace-sm:16:7940":{"uid":"351","name":"Whitespace - Small","type":"design","classes":"my-2","html":"<div class=\"my-2\"></div>","preview":"<div style=\"border-style:dashed; height:10px; width:100%;\"></div>","droppab